  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🔪 傳說中，許多豬布林曾入侵主世界，你可以找到戰爭留下的遺跡，它們有著獨特的外觀。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🦴 探索遺跡：發掘、尋找、獲取並揭開豬布林過去的陰謀，戰利品範例包括：「黑曜石、帶有紋飾的盔甲、武器，使用你的刷子調查礫石，還能獲得更好的物品，如自訂旗幟、藥水、生物頭顱、陶片等。」</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#c9f\"><strong>與世界生成資料包相容，亦適用於 Paper/Spigot 伺服器。（請務必準備備份，因為 Paper 有時會出現錯誤）<br></strong></span><strong>回報錯誤、提供意見回饋，甚至協助開發，我們有一個&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fCZQthZJjPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> </span>頻道，這裡的氛圍超棒！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/949138580415062017?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/632624?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">相容於</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msMOOMq.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"95\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hIpLSyga/images/21e58ce2208b2d3a3b8c513156d5605695883245.png\" alt=\"縮圖\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlBNUql.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3oSlucE.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5UqBQi.png\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H9WJK65dKjo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h3>若想展開冒險，結帳時使用代碼「HOPONO」可享首月 25% 折扣！ ❤️</h3><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fhopono\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/hopono</a></h3><h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CZQthZJjPc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"50\"></a><a href=\"https://www.cursef